xpisode-abc-gello

The GELLO leader logic (encoder mapping, start-up calibration, gripper mapping, soft-limit and
trigger force feedback, the Dynamixel access) is ported from amazon-far/abc, commit d0832d1,
deploy/robot/leaders/{gello_leader,leader_robot,dynamixel}.py, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. Changes: split into pure functions (mapping.py) and a bus (bus.py); one sync read
of current, velocity and position and one sync write of all currents per cycle; the trigger
reported as xpisode's 0 released .. 1 squeezed; a client-set feedback torque added to the
trigger spring; wrapped as an xpisode Device (device.py).
